{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117370","id":3389347051,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7KBVTr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117370","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117370.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117370.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117370","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117370/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117370/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117370/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e453bac3de4c34e13a6ae2a13dedc560c89f8f83","number":117370,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Core: Optimize string formatting and allocation in `String::get_with_code_lines` to single allocation","user":{"login":"Kimau","id":905911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTkxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/905911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau","html_url":"https://github.com/Kimau","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Description\r\n\r\nThis PR optimizes the performance and memory footprint of `get_with_code_lines`. \r\nThe previous implementation relied on `String::split()` and `vformat()` within a loop, which caused excessive heap allocations, temporary array generation, and repeated string concatenations.\r\nThese overheads scaled poorly when processing large source files. \r\n\r\nIt also caused some debugging issues for us tracking down a memory issue due to number of allocations on a specific platform.\r\nIn public branch currently only used by `ShaderRD::_compile_variant`. We use it in a few other places.\r\nEasily could be expanded to take optional error or highlight line var if you want the format\r\n```\r\n     4 |  code\r\nE    5 >  code\r\n     6 |  code\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Refactor details\r\n\r\n- Pre-calculation: Scans the source string once to count newlines and pre-calculate exact memory requirements.\r\n- Single Allocation: Replaces multiple allocations with a single resize_uninitialized() call for the destination buffer.\r\n- Zero-allocation Formatting: Replaces vformat() with a stack-allocated buffer and snprintf for integer formatting.\r\n- Data Transfer: Uses memcpy() to transfer string segments directly into the buffer, improving cache friendliness.\r\n- Scalability: Dynamically adjusts line number padding to support files exceeding 9,999 lines.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":n